# Fast per-file checks after an edit (.claude/hooks/posttooluse-checks.sh).
# Format: <globs>|<cwd>|<command>   ({file} = edited file; cwd `.` or `{pkgdir}`)
# Only already-installed tools run; a missing tool is skipped.
#
# Examples:
# *.ts *.tsx|{pkgdir}|eslint --fix {file}
# *.py|.|ruff check --fix {file}
# *.go|.|gofmt -w {file}
